{title: Tere Bin Ho Na Sakega Guzara}
{artist: K K Paranthe Wali Gali}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Tere bin [A]ho na sakega guzara,        Mil bhi [F#m]gaye to bhi tay hai kinara
Na [E]doori, na [F#m]nazdeeki,        Na [E]doori, na [F#m]nazdeeki
[A]Hai agar,        [D]Tujhse juda hona [E]kismat meri
[A]Hai agar,        [D]Tanhaaiyaan hi [E]sohbat meri
To [F#m]lo ho gaye,        [D]Juda tujhse
[E]Khafa khud se,        [A]Ab na milenge tujhe [F#m]hum kabhi
Ab [A]na [Bm]milenge,        Tujhe [D]hum kabhi
[F#m]Hum kabhi, [A]hum kabhi,        [F#m]Dhoop mein
[D]Yoon hi main jalta tha,        [Bm]Firta main rahta tha, [A]dar badar
[F#m]Tu mila,        [D]Ishq ki chanv mein
[Bm]Mujhko panah mili, [A]kuch pahar,        [F#m]Sukoon yoon mila
Ki [D]lagne laga,        Tu [E]hai wo dua
[A]Abke milega mujhe [F#m]rab yahin,        Ab [A]ke [Bm]milega
Mujhe [D]rab yahin,        [F#m]Rab yahin, [A]rab yahin
[F#m]Tu subah [D]andheri raaton ke,        [Bm]Baad ki [A]pehli fazar
[F#m]Tu junoon, [D]dil mein chupa tha jo,        [Bm]Khul ke wo aaya [A]hai nazar
[F#m]Kismat se gila,        [D]Nahi ab raha
[E]Falak mil gaya,        [A]Dil ko mili hai [F#m]dhadkan abhi
Dil [A]ko [Bm]mili hai,        [D]Dhadkan abhi
[F#m]Dhadkan abhi, [A]Dhadkan abhi,        [F#m]Tere bin [A]ho na sakega guzara
Mil bhi [F#m]gaye to bhi tay hai kinara,        Na [E]doori, na [F#m]nazdeeki
Na [E]doori, na [F#m]nazdeeki
